{"id": "EUVD-2026-80544", "enisaUuid": "8137f9c0-8778-35c8-bee3-a5cae227fde0", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nASoC: hdac_hda: Fix hlink refcount leak on component registration failure\n\nhdac_hda_dev_probe() gets the HDA link with snd_hdac_ext_bus_link_get()\nbefore registering the ASoC component. If component registration fails,\nthe function returns without dropping the link reference.\n\nAlways call snd_hdac_ext_bus_link_put() after the registration attempt so\nthe reference taken during probe is balanced on both success and failure.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:32:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:49:13", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/60b5824ae259ad15f7878e4e763ec31ba4db55f2", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7eef9ae3b4ef782557526dd8ba0c206f028d8c2f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e8ea01a0457080b0cc7c69c430c0ab65d84dc377", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb6b0b1a9d5a61ef841739d42c6211094e9c8e2c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ad4892c4f5cb437a928a02f5b7d37d496aa9268"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89944", "GHSA-4wgj-g6wx-2p76"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "16a996ed-9bd9-3b3c-a370-5b52ceb1ab77", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "281eced6-c065-3128-ad6b-befbb2239fa2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4.20"}, {"id": "38fa9567-8cdd-38c9-86fa-ab59f5214253", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "44aaa5a1-1f81-365c-835f-68a3d0353396", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "5d5a7133-babf-3e6e-ab52-dcd3f7ea1261", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6bae5ea9498926440ffc883f3dbceb0adc65e492 <6ad4892c4f5cb437a928a02f5b7d37d496aa9268"}, {"id": "679c49c0-b0b4-313